    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A beautifully presented two-bedroom first-floor apartment, ideally located in the ever-popular Rosebank Court development. A corner apartment, offering bright, spacious, and well-proportioned accommodation throughout, this impressive property is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, investors, and those looking to downsize.\r\nThe accommodation comprises of a welcoming entrance hall leading to a generous open-plan living and dining area, being a corner apartment, it is flooded with natural light and provides the perfect space for relaxing or entertaining. The modern fitted kitchen is well-equipped with ample storage and workspace. There are two spacious double bedrooms, both featuring built-in wardrobes and both have newly fitted carpet. \r\nThe apartment is further enhanced by secure basement designated parking, excellent storage, and well-maintained communal areas including green spaces.\r\nLOCATION\r\nRosebank Court is ideally located within easy reach of Clondalkin Village, local shops, schools, cafés, parks, and a range of amenities. Excellent transport links, including nearby bus routes, the N7, M50, and LUAS Red Line, provide convenient access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas.\r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION\r\nFirst Floor Apartment\r\nHall (c. 3.79m X .98 m) Solid Oak Timber Flooring\r\nKitchen (c. 4.01m X 3.46m) Fitted with tile flooring, there are upper and base level cabinets, integrated fridge/freezer, oven, dishwasher and plumbed for washing machine.\r\nDining / Living Room (c. 3.73m X 3.05 m) Dual-aspect, open-plan living space fitted with solid oak timber flooring.  \r\nMaster Bedroom (c. 4.44m X 3.61m) Spacious master bedroom fitted with plush carpet and built-in-wardrobes. \r\nEnsuite -  Fitted with tile flooring, electric shower, WC, WHB and full wall tiling.\r\nBedroom 2 (c. 3.63m  X  2.12m) Double bedroom fitted with plush carpet and built-in-wardrobe.\r\nBathroom (c.2.37m X 1.75 m ) Family bathroom fitted with tile flooring, bath, WC, WHB and fully tiled walls.\r\nUtility Room (c. 1.71m X .72m) Providing excellent storage."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "HIGHLIGHTS \r\n•\t2-Bed/2-Bath First Floor Apartment\r\n•\tBright Dual-Aspect Corner Property\r\n•\tDesignated Secure Parking\r\n•\tOpen-Plan Living Space\r\n•\tNew Carpets to Bedrooms\r\n•\tExcellent Storage Throughout\r\n•\tWell-Maintained Communal Green Space\r\n•\tAccess to Abundance of Transport Links \r\n•\tEstate Management Fees: €2580 per annum (with early payment discount)"
